From: EP1991 - Team Thinking_CAPs <erupuri@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:34:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] build(bazel): apply the opensovd_core cargo-bazel-lock
 patch
Eclipse SDV Hackathon Chapter 4 - 2026


patches/opensovd-core-cargo-bazel-lock.patch was exported but not referenced
by the opensovd_core git_override, so crate_universe aborted with
'Digests do not match'.

---
 MODULE.bazel | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/MODULE.bazel b/MODULE.bazel
index 8546853..57cd9ae 100644
--- a/MODULE.bazel
+++ b/MODULE.bazel
@@ -151,5 +151,7 @@ bazel_dep(name = "opensovd_core")
 git_override(
     module_name = "opensovd_core",
     commit = "0cb4b250643164d678389385aa94b6a92bb7f0c7",
+    patch_strip = 1,
+    patches = ["//patches:opensovd-core-cargo-bazel-lock.patch"],
     remote = "https://github.com/eclipse-opensovd/opensovd-core.git",
 )
-- 
